          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Dr. Ken Etticks investigates the oxidation of iodide ion by arsenic acid in aqueous solution. The reaction is: "
            }
          ],
          "id": "a7754bb584ae48a08bb492640b91e2e5",
          "type": "p"
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "6c3wpf094kv0hwm",
              "text": " ",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ],
          "id": "dtt057pnjla4r2w",
          "legacyBlockRendered": "true",
          "src": "3\\;\\mathrm I^-(aq)\\;+\\;{\\mathrm H}_3{\\mathrm{AsO}}_4(aq)\\;+\\;2\\;\\mathrm H^+(aq)\\;\\rightarrow\\;\\mathrm I_3^-(aq)\\;+\\;{\\mathrm H}_3{\\mathrm{AsO}}_3(aq)\\;+\\;{\\mathrm H}_2\\mathrm O(l)",
          "subtype": "latex",
          "type": "formula"
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "During his experiment the following data were collected:  [I"
            },
            {
              "sup": true,
              "text": "-"
            },
            {
              "text": "] = 2.48×10"
            },
            {
              "sup": true,
              "text": "-2"
            },
            {
              "text": " M at t = 65.0 s, and [I"
            },
            {
              "sup": true,
              "text": "-"
            },
            {
              "text": "] = 1.92×10"
            },
            {
              "sup": true,
              "text": "-2"
            },
            {
              "text": " M at t = 75.0 s."
            }
          ],
          "id": "ad82867729b045eeb682cae6cb1cf9c2",
          "type": "p"
        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Calculate the value of "
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "text": ""
                }
              ],
              "legacyBlockRendered": false,
              "src": "\\frac{\\triangle\\lbrack\\mathrm I^-\\rbrack}{\\triangle t}",
              "subtype": "latex",
              "type": "formula_inline"
            },
            {
              "text": " during this time interval. "
            },
            {
